{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["And the reason for <b>he and his wife and all that he had</b> is to inform us that they did not take anything from him of all the great gifts that they gave him on account of Sarah, that she might be the king's, nor did they say, 'You deceived us, and the gift was given under false pretenses.' And this is a miraculous deed."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T04:20:57.056519676Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}